  Breakdown.CoerciveWeak.IsWeakSecondDerivState W HW D → ∀ (σ : ℝ) (y : Breakdown.Space), ‖fderiv ℝ (W σ) y‖ ≤ |D|

∀ {u W₀ : Breakdown.Space → Breakdown.Space}
